  "reason": "The study reports on the safety assessment of BHT, including animal studies and human clinical tests (predictive and provocative skin tests). However, it does not report a quantitative measure of agreement between animal and human results. The human clinical tests are presented independently of the animal data for the purpose of assessing safety in humans, not for comparing the predictive accuracy of animal models."
